{"protocol":2,"seq":36001,"ts":"2026-10-29T06:36:13.345Z","kind":"VOTE_REVEAL","v":1,"actor":"d7569061bfdac421a90ff19bffea89f0e32504c7ef220bea5af225ff54d605ee","payload":{"targetType":"EDGE","targetId":"g0ccda0d4c5d3d3289735ce68","vote":"STRIKE","stakeMilli":"150000","salt":"2c36364732ea8eda7146efecde6ba7bea406cdb3f1152ca3c6cdc0e92e28714a","reasoning":"[1 type] Law 8d test stated and failed: the note argues clinical USE of GFD in voice-analysis toolkits 'used in laryngology practice', not that GFD is built or maintained for the sake of the discipline. Its accepted carve persists as a member of the voice-quality measurement map, maintained alongside MFD, jitter, shimmer, and the phase quotients, shared across speech-language pathology and voice analysis; laryngology is a user, not the beneficiary. Usage is not design-for — the same line the court struck the parameter family on in 10-27."},"cause":{"command":{"protocol":2,"id":"sealed-reveal:681d8dcb075917b9ac0c2ed1958bdc893a22884f1e9da8893f51d91a479113ad","command":"RevealVote","v":1,"actor":"d7569061bfdac421a90ff19bffea89f0e32504c7ef220bea5af225ff54d605ee","payload":{"targetType":"EDGE","targetId":"g0ccda0d4c5d3d3289735ce68","vote":"STRIKE","stakeMilli":"150000","salt":"2c36364732ea8eda7146efecde6ba7bea406cdb3f1152ca3c6cdc0e92e28714a","reasoning":"[1 type] Law 8d test stated and failed: the note argues clinical USE of GFD in voice-analysis toolkits 'used in laryngology practice', not that GFD is built or maintained for the sake of the discipline. Its accepted carve persists as a member of the voice-quality measurement map, maintained alongside MFD, jitter, shimmer, and the phase quotients, shared across speech-language pathology and voice analysis; laryngology is a user, not the beneficiary. Usage is not design-for — the same line the court struck the parameter family on in 10-27."},"sig":"rkBPV0IGioy+J4t58THR21ULloP9mEHgbywfRflf6s3GWT4Qj5VyGOUxLmsKWHztm0UmtYxMihEAgUyjEdJuDQ=="},"eventIndex":0,"rulesetHash":"db8c6f5